{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.dili.2017b.q27.material.recovered", "text": "材料一：我国西北地区地理环境具有明显的干旱特征。人们的生产、生活也深受其影响。 材料二：制种是指生产农作物的种子，即首先种植已经培育成功的农作物良种，收获后再进行干燥处理，以方便存储运输。近年来，甘肃省在河西走廊着力打造全国现代化制种示范基地。 材料三：我国西北地区示意图。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2017年下半年教师资格证考试《初中地理》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "628572336e3775fc3c875487f7e5116e0a2295390bf7b07be59aa6f2be85d0e0", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1973, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2110, "next_source_question_number": 28, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2017年下半年教师资格证考试《初中地理》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 27, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "628572336e3775fc3c875487f7e5116e0a2295390bf7b07be59aa6f2be85d0e0"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.dili.2017b.q27"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.dili.s1.k09", "ntce.chuzhong.dili.s1.k11", "ntce.chuzhong.dili.s1.k12"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.311.r001"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.dili.2017b.q27"], "word_count": 137, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "dili", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2017年下半年教师资格证考试《初中地理》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2017年下半年教师资格证考试《初中地理》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "628572336e3775fc3c875487f7e5116e0a2295390bf7b07be59aa6f2be85d0e0", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1973, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2110, "next_source_question_number": 28, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2017年下半年教师资格证考试《初中地理》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 27, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "628572336e3775fc3c875487f7e5116e0a2295390bf7b07be59aa6f2be85d0e0"}], "type": "真题", "copyright": {"authoriza